WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.400
Open Add audiogram. All information here is fictional.

00:02.400 --> 00:04.600
Give the test a title and provider; check the test date.

00:04.600 --> 00:09.100
Add a measurement and enter its threshold. Check ear and frequency.

00:09.100 --> 00:12.300
Confirm review, then save. The result appears in your local history.
